    "code": "SSC-EWI-TS0219",
    "description": "XACT_STATE() COMPARISON IS NOT SUPPORTED IN SNOWFLAKE. CURRENT_TRANSACTION() RETURNS A TRANSACTION ID, NOT A STATE CODE, AND SNOWFLAKE HAS NO UNCOMMITTABLE TRANSACTION STATE, SO ONLY COMPARISONS WITH 0 OR 1 HAVE AN EQUIVALENT.",
